Description:

An IMAP session's rights on the selected mailbox are now refreshed before each
command.  Previously, the rights a user held when the mailbox was opened with
SELECT or EXAMINE endured for as long as that mailbox stayed open, so revoking
a user's access to a shared mailbox did not stop them from continuing to use it
through an existing connection.


