(not yet assigned)
Tracked as GitHub security advisory GHSA-29j5-55f2-ch2f.


CVE description:

Revoked mailbox access not enforced on an already-selected mailbox

When an authenticated user's access to a shared mailbox is revoked by the
sharing user, they retain access through any existing connection's current
mailbox selection until the mailbox is closed or the session ends.


